            """Glacial retreat raises downstream flood risk (GLOFs), alters river seasonality, threatens irrigation and hydropower, and contributes to sea-level rise globally. Livelihoods of mountain communities, biodiversity, and cultural landscapes change. Impacts cascade to cities far from ice through water insecurity and disaster shocks — hence “beyond the local landscape.” Himalayan Asia is a prime illustration of teleconnected cryosphere risk.""",
